Or just go ahead and enchant the hell out of Magicbane. It'll be a lot
less funky, but it'll do more average and _much_ more reliable damage
than it does at +2.
Magicbane is only best at +2 if you don't use it for the damage but
for the side effects, which are random - you shouldn't wager your life
on them. If you're looking at average damage and minimum damage,
Magicbane is best at +7.

Mind, i'd still enchant Firebrand. It effectively gets double the
bonus from enchantments and it's a mighty fine weapon against undead
and angels.

