Full agreement on the last. But i think 350 hp are overkill, even for
a first foray into Gehennom. 250+ should be plenty for a wizard,
particularly if you put some extra work into the AC (which is already
pretty good, but getting to about -35 would be nice before making a
grab for the amulet itself). Whenever i managed to get myself killed
with 250HPs, i would still have died with 400HPs, because there was
something wrong with my general tactics or i got killed by something
other than hitpoint loss. And the solution wasn't pumping maxhp more,
but changing tactics and watching those nasty special effects.

